{"parentUuid":"74314d19-dc49-4b96-8f74-0308e1727fe8","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dev/quillmark","sessionId":"buried-08","version":"2.0.17","gitBranch":"docs/themes-guide","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_01l6vva0v358lzMcx8Zvd5Nj","content":"     1\t---\n     2\ttitle: Fonts\n     3\tweight: 20\n     4\tdescription: Use your own fonts in Quillmark documents.\n     5\t---\n     6\t\n     7\tQuillmark embeds the fonts it uses into every PDF. The built-in themes use\n     8\tSource Serif and Source Sans, which ship with Quillmark.\n     9\t\n    10\t## Add a font directory\n    11\t\n    12\tPass `-font-dir` to render with the fonts in a directory:\n    13\t\n    14\t```sh\n    15\tquill render -font-dir ./fonts -o book.pdf book.md\n    16\t```\n    17\t\n    18\tSee [Themes](../themes/) to use a font in a theme."}]},"uuid":"9ec6c3c5-5733-4b9b-83c2-dc14d3899974","timestamp":"2026-10-10T13:58:18.000Z"}
