{"parentUuid":"31f67313-03f2-4a9a-aba9-fd1194e199f8","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dev/quillmark","sessionId":"buried-08","version":"2.0.17","gitBranch":"docs/themes-guide","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_01XSemNsgf4LXQ1ILm4DZI7G","content":"internal/theme/theme.go:12:\tName       string `toml:\"name\"`\ninternal/theme/theme.go:13:\tBody       string `toml:\"body\"`\ninternal/theme/theme.go:14:\tHeadings   string `toml:\"headings\"`\ninternal/theme/theme.go:15:\tInk        string `toml:\"ink\"`\ninternal/theme/theme.go:16:\tBackground string `toml:\"background\"`\ninternal/theme/theme.go:17:\tAccent     string `toml:\"accent\"`\ninternal/theme/theme.go:18:\tPage       *PageSpec `toml:\"page\"`\ninternal/theme/theme.go:24:\tSize    string `toml:\"size\"`\ninternal/theme/theme.go:25:\tMargins string `toml:\"margins\"`"}]},"uuid":"cc092159-8fe4-4e8e-b996-87bad789454f","timestamp":"2026-10-10T14:00:22.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"cc092159-8fe4-4e8e-b996-87bad789454f","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dev/quillmark","sessionId":"buried-08","version":"2.0.17","gitBranch":"docs/themes-guide","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_018IL0Zm1rCxN2BQWbu0JCdW","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-sonnet-4-5","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011cU34331IuZhuPCh1qpJ25","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/home/dev/quillmark/docs/content/guide/themes.md","old_string":"accent = \"#0b4f6c\"\n```\n","new_string":"accent = \"#0b4f6c\"\n```\n\nQuillmark looks for a theme in this order and uses the first it finds:\n\n1. `./themes/<name>.toml`, next to the document\n2. `~/.config/quillmark/themes/<name>.toml` (or under `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`)\n3. the built-in themes\n\nSo a file called `themes/paper.toml` replaces the built-in `paper`.\n\n### Theme fields\n\n| Field | Meaning | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| `name` | the name you pass to `-theme` | `\"harbour\"` |\n| `body` | font of the running text | `\"Source Serif 4\"` |\n| `headings` | font of the headings | `\"Source Sans 3\"` |\n| `ink` | colour of the text | `\"#1d2733\"` |\n| `background` | colour of the page | `\"#ffffff\"` |\n| `accent` | colour of links and rules | `\"#0b4f6c\"` |\n| `page.size` | page size, overrides the default | `\"A4\"` |\n| `page.margins` | margins, vertical then horizontal | `\"18mm 16mm\"` |\n\nFonts must be installed or in a font directory; see [Fonts](../fonts/).\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","usage":{"input_tokens":415,"output_tokens":398}},"uuid":"efc7fc63-681d-4806-9beb-8e4aa99913a6","timestamp":"2026-10-10T14:00:26.000Z","requestId":"req_011CuSBEHx3aZsn2E3aCiL4s"}
