{"parentUuid":"42a37462-a818-45cd-a48c-b9b66bbe1854","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dev/quillmark","sessionId":"buried-08","version":"2.0.17","gitBranch":"docs/themes-guide","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_01ApdDVRJcqmHIJ5rGJl2GZC","content":"The same page in <code>paper</code> and in <code>ink</code>:</p><!-- raw HTML omitted --><h2 id=custom-themes>Custom themes</h2>"}]},"uuid":"6405a7d8-27be-470d-a191-2de8807ce295","timestamp":"2026-10-10T14:04:19.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"6405a7d8-27be-470d-a191-2de8807ce295","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dev/quillmark","sessionId":"buried-08","version":"2.0.17","gitBranch":"docs/themes-guide","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_019PGDa2FpJ3wpCxjpuCjizn","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-sonnet-4-5","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That's the cause. Hugo renders Markdown with Goldmark, and by default Goldmark does not pass raw HTML through: each HTML block in a Markdown file is replaced with an <!-- raw HTML omitted --> comment, unless the site sets markup.goldmark.renderer.unsafe = true. My div with the two figures was dropped silently, the build reports no warning, and I only checked that the build and the links passed, not the rendered page.\n\nTwo ways to fix it:\n\n1. Set unsafe = true in hugo.toml. It is one line, but it allows raw HTML in every content file of the site.\n2. A shortcode in docs/layouts/shortcodes that renders the figure pair, used from the Markdown as {{< theme-pair >}}. Shortcode templates are not subject to the raw HTML rule.\n\nI'd prefer the shortcode, which keeps the default and can be reused for the other theme comparisons."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","usage":{"input_tokens":497,"output_tokens":531}},"uuid":"3a518851-1388-4e8c-8c5d-4fe1c6cc1b25","timestamp":"2026-10-10T14:04:27.000Z","requestId":"req_011CbiYOqFDHZVphgyBHZOAI"}
{"parentUuid":"3a518851-1388-4e8c-8c5d-4fe1c6cc1b25","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dev/quillmark","sessionId":"buried-08","version":"2.0.17","gitBranch":"docs/themes-guide","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Shortcode. Don't turn on unsafe."},"uuid":"145fcc6e-bdd9-4979-9aaa-a960177c7e3f","timestamp":"2026-10-10T14:05:03.000Z"}
